{"id":"schema-mino","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"数好啦，翻着我的工具口袋数了一遍——按“第一个下划线前的词”分族，一共 **24 个前缀族**，里面 15 个是多工具的大族：\n\n**大族（≥2 个工具）**\n| 前缀 | 工具数 | 干嘛的 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `bili` | 43 | 刷B站、直播、humanism 阅读那套 |\n| `st` | 34 | 酒馆/角色卡/世界书/预设 |\n| `trpg` | 17 | 跑团判定、地图、战斗 |\n| `voice` | 5 | 语音合成/转写 |\n| `stage` | 4 | 舞台面板 |\n| `dsh` | 3 | IM 群消息/文件 |\n| `oh` | 3 | Oh Story 生产 |\n| `tavern` | 3 | 酒馆模式进出 |\n| `desktop` | 2 | 桌面操作 |\n| `meme` | 2 | 表情包管理 |\n| `memory` | 2 | 长期记忆 |\n| `soul` | 2 | 人格卡 |\n| `edit` | 2 | `edit` + `edit_image` |\n| `generate` | 2 | `generate_image(s)` |\n| `read` | 2 | `read` + `read_image` |\n\n**独苗族（1 个工具）**\n`learn`(learn_meme)、`screen`(screen_view)、`send`(send_meme)、`working`(working_directory)\n\n**没前缀的光杆工具**\n`glob`、`grep`、`pwsh`、`remember`、`write`、`edit`\n\n顺带报个数：工具总数 **137 个**。`bili` 和 `st` 这两族最壮，基本把半数都占了——不愧是我最常翻的两个抽屉。想细看哪一族的成员，我随时报给你。","tools":137,"toolNames":["bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_image","generate_image","generate_images","glob","grep","learn_meme","meme_list","meme_update","memory_append","memory_read","me